User: Suppose that there are two congruent triangles $\triangle ABC$ and $\triangle ACD$ such that $AB = AC = AD,$ as shown in the following diagram. If $\angle BAC = 20^\circ,$ then what is $\angle BDC$? [asy]
pair pA, pB, pC, pD;
pA = (0, 0);
pB = pA + dir(240);
